gin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}[f(t)+\\frac{5}{3}g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+\\frac{5}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,1,\\,4⟩+\\frac{5}{3}⟨-3,\\,6,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,1,\\,4⟩+⟨-5,\\,10,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-7,\\,11,\\,4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b5ee2c23-f39d-50cc-8ad6-40fbb0395dc9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b5ee2c23-f39d-50cc-8ad6-40fbb0395dc9" :answer-field/id #uuid "b5ee2c23-f39d-50cc-8ad6-40fbb0395dc9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c8cf5629-cbfe-56cf-80b8-847fb1feda67" :answer-field/choices ["answer-59708d17-ec19-5008-a725-f506623819e7" "answer-c8cf5629-cbfe-56cf-80b8-847fb1feda67" "answer-d960990e-be34-50b8-8883-ca8b7c72ab98" "answer-c1f48cd2-7a1e-5567-a774-54e3c2cd766d" "answer-475d1e66-6f6e-5029-b393-ac8091e81847"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59708d17-ec19-5008-a725-f506623819e7" :answer/id #uuid "59708d17-ec19-5008-a725-f506623819e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,11,\\,0⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c8cf5629-cbfe-56cf-80b8-847fb1feda67" :answer/id #uuid "c8cf5629-cbfe-56cf-80b8-847fb1feda67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-7,\\,11,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d960990e-be34-50b8-8883-ca8b7c72ab98" :answer/id #uuid "d960990e-be34-50b8-8883-ca8b7c72ab98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-7,\\,8,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c1f48cd2-7a1e-5567-a774-54e3c2cd766d" :answer/id #uuid "c1f48cd2-7a1e-5567-a774-54e3c2cd766d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,\\,11,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-475d1e66-6f6e-5029-b393-ac8091e81847" :answer/id #uuid "475d1e66-6f6e-5029-b393-ac8091e81847" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,10,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-936ae073-f786-5498-b379-ef3a0cdfd96d" :question/id #uuid "936ae073-f786-5498-b379-ef3a0cdfd96d" :question/math-academy-id "q-32496" :question/problem "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{1}[6f(t)-2g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,-\\frac{2}{3},\\,3⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1}[6f(t)-2g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=6{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-2{\\int }_{0}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}[6f(t)-2g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =6{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-2{\\int }_{0}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =6⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,-\\frac{2}{3},\\,3⟩-2⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-4,\\,18⟩-⟨2,\\,2,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-6,\\,16⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c9391d8f-51c6-50ad-a822-94facfbb487b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c9391d8f-51c6-50ad-a822-94facfbb487b" :answer-field/id #uuid "c9391d8f-51c6-50ad-a822-94facfbb487b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-28a82d4e-66b8-522b-bb29-15ce2137bdbf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-69479ad1-c6b2-5a1b-806d-681f0eb3c7e4" "answer-bb058d20-70c9-58d9-8796-636b8520c920" "answer-28a82d4e-66b8-522b-bb29-15ce2137bdbf" "answer-617f6a04-b5a3-562e-944b-b155e9ef1135" "answer-1b4f82ad-fdb2-5472-91cf-034c72d89d1f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-69479ad1-c6b2-5a1b-806d-681f0eb3c7e4" :answer/id #uuid "69479ad1-c6b2-5a1b-806d-681f0eb3c7e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,6,\\,16⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bb058d20-70c9-58d9-8796-636b8520c920" :answer/id #uuid "bb058d20-70c9-58d9-8796-636b8520c920" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-5,\\,-6,\\,20⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-28a82d4e-66b8-522b-bb29-15ce2137bdbf" :answer/id #uuid "28a82d4e-66b8-522b-bb29-15ce2137bdbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,\\,-6,\\,16⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-617f6a04-b5a3-562e-944b-b155e9ef1135" :answer/id #uuid "617f6a04-b5a3-562e-944b-b155e9ef1135" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,\\,6,\\,16⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1b4f82ad-fdb2-5472-91cf-034c72d89d1f" :answer/id #uuid "1b4f82ad-fdb2-5472-91cf-034c72d89d1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5,\\,-2,\\,20⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186120556 :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)+⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-2,\\,3,\\,4⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-2,\\,3,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-3,\\,-4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)+⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{1}⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-3,\\,-4⟩+{⟨t,\\,t,\\,t⟩|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-3,\\,-4⟩+⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-2,\\,-3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186119449 :answer-field/correct "answer-00e985bc-3646-55e6-b3a2-05849e559813" :answer-field/choices ["answer-00e985bc-3646-55e6-b3a2-05849e559813" "answer-7182028f-2b74-5eac-980c-1d5e909f08df" "answer-0c92cdac-b992-5f56-8073-a74a63b8e267" "answer-1431b01c-fbae-5eca-ba0e-3973bfffb5d2" "answer-d2a507f5-177d-52c0-bc32-cfb379389058"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-00e985bc-3646-55e6-b3a2-05849e559813" :answer/id #uuid "00e985bc-3646-55e6-b3a2-05849e559813" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,-2,\\,-3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7182028f-2b74-5eac-980c-1d5e909f08df" :answer/id #uuid "7182028f-2b74-5eac-980c-1d5e909f08df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,-2,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0c92cdac-b992-5f56-8073-a74a63b8e267" :answer/id #uuid "0c92cdac-b992-5f56-8073-a74a63b8e267" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,2,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1431b01c-fbae-5eca-ba0e-3973bfffb5d2" :answer/id #uuid "1431b01c-fbae-5eca-ba0e-3973bfffb5d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,1,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d2a507f5-177d-52c0-bc32-cfb379389058" :answer/id #uuid "d2a507f5-177d-52c0-bc32-cfb379389058" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,1,\\,-3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-099cadcd-00ea-506e-8b07-43c526063b36" :question/id #uuid "099cadcd-00ea-506e-8b07-43c526063b36" :question/math-academy-id "q-98263" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨6,\\,-2,\\,-4⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨3,\\,5,\\,-7⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\cdot ⟨6,\\,-2,\\,-4⟩-⟨3,\\,5,\\,-7⟩ \\\\  & =⟨12,\\,-4,\\,-8⟩-⟨3,\\,5,\\,-7⟩ \\\\  & =⟨9,\\,-9,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a178f3a9-4495-5692-ab36-8240a8fd4002"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a178f3a9-4495-5692-ab36-8240a8fd4002" :answer-field/id #uuid "a178f3a9-4495-5692-ab36-8240a8fd4002" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1bd98d57-852f-5bdb-bd6a-571e37b35316" :answer-field/choices ["answer-13aaa82b-134d-5ac3-8299-d9ab861ac6d5" "answer-15863b1c-cda3-5899-907a-75cfcee2a5c8" "answer-26cb0adc-a799-5679-8285-567c012449b4" "answer-a5e0035b-953e-5269-97ce-c86bb0d7f0b8" "answer-1bd98d57-852f-5bdb-bd6a-571e37b35316"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-13aaa82b-134d-5ac3-8299-d9ab861ac6d5" :answer/id #uuid "13aaa82b-134d-5ac3-8299-d9ab861ac6d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-3,\\,7,\\,-3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-15863b1c-cda3-5899-907a-75cfcee2a5c8" :answer/id #uuid "15863b1c-cda3-5899-907a-75cfcee2a5c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,\\,7,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-26cb0adc-a799-5679-8285-567c012449b4" :answer/id #uuid "26cb0adc-a799-5679-8285-567c012449b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,-9,\\,3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a5e0035b-953e-5269-97ce-c86bb0d7f0b8" :answer/id #uuid "a5e0035b-953e-5269-97ce-c86bb0d7f0b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨9,\\,-4,\\,-5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1bd98d57-852f-5bdb-bd6a-571e37b35316" :answer/id #uuid "1bd98d57-852f-5bdb-bd6a-571e37b35316" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨9,\\,-9,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-0dd4df5a-0e6b-52af-bfbd-9f8a6a0eb73b" :question/id #uuid "0dd4df5a-0e6b-52af-bfbd-9f8a6a0eb73b" :question/math-academy-id "q-129273" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨6,\\,-2,\\,4⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{4}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨3,\\,-1,\\,2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{4}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,2⟩-⟨6,\\,-2,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-9,\\,3,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5fcc12cf-1a92-5a62-8733-9c5f6c91157d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5fcc12cf-1a92-5a62-8733-9c5f6c91157d" :answer-field/id #uuid "5fcc12cf-1a92-5a62-8733-9c5f6c91157d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d231f7b9-7f46-59da-906f-71bc37334995" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6c26fae9-27e1-5a9e-b8cc-cb6d50822c49" "answer-d231f7b9-7f46-59da-906f-71bc37334995" "answer-bac614d5-c883-5f75-be5e-9a172f5f740e" "answer-bfd1551e-45c9-59c0-b91f-7e4eb6a9ca61" "answer-23bcd99d-a4d7-5113-8122-b434800d4251"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c26fae9-27e1-5a9e-b8cc-cb6d50822c49" :answer/id #uuid "6c26fae9-27e1-5a9e-b8cc-cb6d50822c49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-3,\\,-3,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d231f7b9-7f46-59da-906f-71bc37334995" :answer/id #uuid "d231f7b9-7f46-59da-906f-71bc37334995" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-9,\\,3,\\,-6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bac614d5-c883-5f75-be5e-9a172f5f740e" :answer/id #uuid "bac614d5-c883-5f75-be5e-9a172f5f740e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,-3,\\,-4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bfd1551e-45c9-59c0-b91f-7e4eb6a9ca61" :answer/id #uuid "bfd1551e-45c9-59c0-b91f-7e4eb6a9ca61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,3,\\,-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23bcd99d-a4d7-5113-8122-b434800d4251" :answer/id #uuid "23bcd99d-a4d7-5113-8122-b434800d4251" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨9,\\,1,\\,-8⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-47592607-bdfd-5d8e-9c5b-5217893655c3" :question/id #uuid "47592607-bdfd-5d8e-9c5b-5217893655c3" :question/math-academy-id "q-129271" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨15,\\,3,\\,6⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{2}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨12,\\,2,\\,4⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{2}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{2}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{2}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨15,\\,3,\\,6⟩-⟨12,\\,2,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,1,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1ce4d30d-9663-5cde-be1f-6bc470206c3c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1ce4d30d-9663-5cde-be1f-6bc470206c3c" :answer-field/id #uuid "1ce4d30d-9663-5cde-be1f-6bc470206c3c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1cb8259f-8c90-5906-950d-4eceda1af95a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a45f0695-37ea-5976-9377-b321aab76838" "answer-3577fefa-4330-511f-bfb5-e3b0bdd5b2d7" "answer-aaf3598f-9c3e-57f6-8286-eee1de57ab13" "answer-9bb2546e-95e7-5c4f-8882-4b1f0f221022" "answer-1cb8259f-8c90-5906-950d-4eceda1af95a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a45f0695-37ea-5976-9377-b321aab76838" :answer/id #uuid "a45f0695-37ea-5976-9377-b321aab76838" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,-5,\\,3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3577fefa-4330-511f-bfb5-e3b0bdd5b2d7" :answer/id #uuid "3577fefa-4330-511f-bfb5-e3b0bdd5b2d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,5,\\,3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aaf3598f-9c3e-57f6-8286-eee1de57ab13" :answer/id #uuid "aaf3598f-9c3e-57f6-8286-eee1de57ab13" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-3,\\,-1,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9bb2546e-95e7-5c4f-8882-4b1f0f221022" :answer/id #uuid "9bb2546e-95e7-5c4f-8882-4b1f0f221022" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-3,\\,3,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1cb8259f-8c90-5906-950d-4eceda1af95a" :answer/id #uuid "1cb8259f-8c90-5906-950d-4eceda1af95a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,1,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9dfd8a34-cf86-59cc-aba6-9a0a73cfe2af" :question/id #uuid "9dfd8a34-cf86-59cc-aba6-9a0a73cfe2af" :question/math-academy-id "q-129296" :question/problem "Find ${\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=7\\,i-4\\,j-k$ \nand \n$c=3\\,i-5\\,j+2\\,k.$" :question/worked-solution "The cross-product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the cross-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(3\\,i-5\\,j+2\\,k)\\times (7\\,i-4\\,j-k) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 7 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 \\\\ -4 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 7 & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 \\\\ 7 & -4\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(5+8)i-(-3-14)j+(-12+35)k \\\\  & =13\\,i+17\\,j+23\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-cd206ea4-1fa4-5b1a-b95a-d7f9dcd15b33"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-cd206ea4-1fa4-5b1a-b95a-d7f9dcd15b33" :answer-field/id #uuid "cd206ea4-1fa4-5b1a-b95a-d7f9dcd15b33" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a78142dc-7eec-57bb-a2d3-d7dcffeea81b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4eafeb6b-988b-5aa2-8275-39f0afff0b14" "answer-9797327b-29d3-5967-8722-3e2bb5aa98ed" "answer-0735890c-3c78-543f-89dd-6ca5377bb2e9" "answer-a78142dc-7eec-57bb-a2d3-d7dcffeea81b" "answer-4be058a2-5710-5ff7-a820-882c2fc11385"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4eafeb6b-988b-5aa2-8275-39f0afff0b14" :answer/id #uuid "4eafeb6b-988b-5aa2-8275-39f0afff0b14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-11\\,i+15\\,j-2\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9797327b-29d3-5967-8722-3e2bb5aa98ed" :answer/id #uuid "9797327b-29d3-5967-8722-3e2bb5aa98ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-15\\,i+16\\,j-24\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0735890c-3c78-543f-89dd-6ca5377bb2e9" :answer/id #uuid "0735890c-3c78-543f-89dd-6ca5377bb2e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\,i+17\\,j-12\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a78142dc-7eec-57bb-a2d3-d7dcffeea81b" :answer/id #uuid "a78142dc-7eec-57bb-a2d3-d7dcffeea81b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13\\,i+17\\,j+23\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4be058a2-5710-5ff7-a820-882c2fc11385" :answer/id #uuid "4be058a2-5710-5ff7-a820-882c2fc11385" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\,i+7\\,j-24\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-90fd82d6-81fe-5d91-84c9-583a4bc9e1c4" :question/id #uuid "90fd82d6-81fe-5d91-84c9-583a4bc9e1c4" :question/math-academy-id "q-129288" :question/problem "Given that \n${\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{e}{2}\\,i+3e\\,j-\\,k,$ \n$c=4\\,i-j+u\\,k,$\nand \n${\\int }_{1}^{3}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=0,$ what is the value of $u?$" :question/worked-solution "The dot product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{3}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\cdot {\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the dot-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\cdot {\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(4\\,i-j+u\\,k)\\cdot (\\frac{e}{2}\\,i+3e\\,j-k) \\\\  & =2e-3e-u \\\\  & =-e-u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${\\int }_{1}^{3}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=0,$ we must have $-e-u=0,$ which means that $u=-e.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-18b293a5-b7ee-51c5-a5dd-f201959d8404"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-18b293a5-b7ee-51c5-a5dd-f201959d8404" :answer-field/id #uuid "18b293a5-b7ee-51c5-a5dd-f201959d8404" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-77824988-4246-5cea-8838-bc3d0f779587" :answer-field/choices ["answer-77824988-4246-5cea-8838-bc3d0f779587" "answer-16f5d70b-9eea-5eb4-936b-2c00a263ca0f" "answer-e6089965-6e3e-5a22-aa9e-148dc9abdb27" "answer-a89108bd-e5fa-5710-9681-caef88996500" "answer-e91ca837-f562-5561-8d71-ccbc1a47662d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-77824988-4246-5cea-8838-bc3d0f779587" :answer/id #uuid "77824988-4246-5cea-8838-bc3d0f779587" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-16f5d70b-9eea-5eb4-936b-2c00a263ca0f" :answer/id #uuid "16f5d70b-9eea-5eb4-936b-2c00a263ca0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e6089965-6e3e-5a22-aa9e-148dc9abdb27" :answer/id #uuid "e6089965-6e3e-5a22-aa9e-148dc9abdb27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a89108bd-e5fa-5710-9681-caef88996500" :answer/id #uuid "a89108bd-e5fa-5710-9681-caef88996500" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2e-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e91ca837-f562-5561-8d71-ccbc1a47662d" :answer/id #uuid "e91ca837-f562-5561-8d71-ccbc1a47662d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3-2e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186120181 :question/problem "Find ${\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=16\\,i+8\\,j+2\\,k$ \nand \n$c=-i+j.$" :question/worked-solution "The cross-product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the cross-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(-i+j)\\times (16\\,i+8\\,j+2\\,k) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 16 & 8 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 16 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 16 & 8\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(2-0)i-(-2-0)j+(-8-16)k \\\\  & =2i+2j-24k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186117247 :answer-field/correct "answer-1f61aaf4-763c-5aa0-8b51-415ad9b6527c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0c143a77-e1af-52aa-b7eb-98785edc55ae" "answer-bfc32dcc-74ea-50ee-823d-5aefc081089d" "answer-56eb2684-dae3-5d7e-affd-236ebbf2899e" "answer-cb6245d5-3350-59d5-9f2f-1fe8e4fa79d8" "answer-1f61aaf4-763c-5aa0-8b51-415ad9b6527c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0c143a77-e1af-52aa-b7eb-98785edc55ae" :answer/id #uuid "0c143a77-e1af-52aa-b7eb-98785edc55ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2i+2j+24k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bfc32dcc-74ea-50ee-823d-5aefc081089d" :answer/id #uuid "bfc32dcc-74ea-50ee-823d-5aefc081089d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2i+2j-8k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-56eb2684-dae3-5d7e-affd-236ebbf2899e" :answer/id #uuid "56eb2684-dae3-5d7e-affd-236ebbf2899e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2i-2j+8k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb6245d5-3350-59d5-9f2f-1fe8e4fa79d8" :answer/id #uuid "cb6245d5-3350-59d5-9f2f-1fe8e4fa79d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2i+2j+8k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1f61aaf4-763c-5aa0-8b51-415ad9b6527c" :answer/id #uuid "1f61aaf4-763c-5aa0-8b51-415ad9b6527c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2i+2j-24k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-42e2902f-b402-5b6e-826c-93f62fddd9ed" :question/id #uuid "42e2902f-b402-5b6e-826c-93f62fddd9ed" :question/math-academy-id "q-129293" :question/problem "Find ${\\int }_{1}^{5}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=i-j+3\\,k$ \nand \n$c=2\\,i-k.$" :question/worked-solution "The cross-product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{5}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\times {\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the cross-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\times {\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(2\\,i-k)\\times (i-j+3\\,k) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0-1)i-(6+1)j+(-2-0)k \\\\  & =-i-7\\,j-2\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-648beb9f-469a-53fa-a29e-23cb1da4aeb4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-648beb9f-469a-53fa-a29e-23cb1da4aeb4" :answer-field/id #uuid "648beb9f-469a-53fa-a29e-23cb1da4aeb4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d2c65bc8-479e-5100-94af-a35f364e4685" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a19efb0d-cd16-5561-9b60-33edcdd0cf62" "answer-a3ba84af-5ed3-53ad-87ee-31f41e20153c" "answer-d2c65bc8-479e-5100-94af-a35f364e4685" "answer-656b4822-846d-53ba-8264-7ca1a6236744" "answer-0d99e8a1-d9f3-5f82-af54-6968a95a1bf3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a19efb0d-cd16-5561-9b60-33edcdd0cf62" :answer/id #uuid "a19efb0d-cd16-5561-9b60-33edcdd0cf62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\,i+7\\,j-4\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a3ba84af-5ed3-53ad-87ee-31f41e20153c" :answer/id #uuid "a3ba84af-5ed3-53ad-87ee-31f41e20153c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-i+2\\,j-3\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d2c65bc8-479e-5100-94af-a35f364e4685" :answer/id #uuid "d2c65bc8-479e-5100-94af-a35f364e4685" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-i-7\\,j-2\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-656b4822-846d-53ba-8264-7ca1a6236744" :answer/id #uuid "656b4822-846d-53ba-8264-7ca1a6236744" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i+4\\,j-2\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0d99e8a1-d9f3-5f82-af54-6968a95a1bf3" :answer/id #uuid "0d99e8a1-d9f3-5f82-af54-6968a95a1bf3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i+7\\,j-k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186120995 :tutorial/content "Since the integration of vector functions is done component-by-component, the properties of integrals of vector functions are immediately inherited from those of the integrals of real-valued functions. \n\nSuppose that $\\mathbf f(t)$ and $\\mathbf g(t)$ are vector-valued functions that are continuous on a closed interval $[a,b],$ and $\\alpha$ is a scalar. \nThen, the *vector addition and scalar multiplication rules* are as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{a}^{b}(f(t)+g(t))\\text{d}t={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\\,+\\,{\\int }_{a}^{b}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t\\, & \\text{vector addition rule} \\\\ {\\int }_{a}^{b}\\alpha \\,f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\alpha \\,{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\\, & \\text{scalar constant multiple rule}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nFor example, if $\\mathbf f(t) = \\left\\langle t, \\: \\cos t\\right\\rangle$ and $\\mathbf g(t) = \\left\\langle -t^2, \\: \\sin t \\right\\rangle,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int [f(t)+2g(t)]\\text{d}t & =\\int f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+2\\int g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int ⟨t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t+2\\int ⟨-{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨\\int t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩+⟨2\\int -{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,2\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{t}^{2}}{2}+{C}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{C}_{2}⟩+⟨-\\frac{2{t}^{3}}{3}+{C}_{3},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{C}_{4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{3{t}^{2}-4{t}^{3}}{6},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nwhere $C_1, \\, C_2, \\, C_3, \\, C_4$ are arbitrary real constants and ${\\mathbf C} = \\langle C_1+C_3, C_2+C_4 \\rangle$ is a constant vector." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186119983 :activity/expected-seconds 660.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
